{"frases": [{"a": 0, "b": 1.515, "t": "Your cat secretly speaks to you.", "k": ["secretly"], "w": [0.056, 0.282, 0.465, 0.865, 1.178, 1.317]}, {"a": 1.515, "b": 3.4320000000000004, "t": "And it might explain more than you think.", "k": ["explain"], "w": [1.565, 1.747, 1.887, 2.156, 2.513, 2.739, 2.965, 3.148]}, {"a": 3.4320000000000004, "b": 6.196000000000001, "t": "Careful, there might be other details you're missing.", "k": ["missing."], "w": [3.482, 3.904, 4.174, 4.443, 4.582, 4.852, 5.209, 5.478]}, {"a": 6.196000000000001, "b": 8.026, "t": "Kittens meow to call their mother.", "k": ["Kittens"], "w": [6.246, 6.598, 6.821, 6.958, 7.181, 7.447]}, {"a": 8.026, "b": 10.065, "t": "But adult cats rarely meow at each other.", "k": ["rarely"], "w": [8.076, 8.27, 8.557, 8.797, 9.13, 9.371, 9.519, 9.759]}, {"a": 10.065, "b": 12.776, "t": "They use scent, body language, hisses and growls.", "k": ["language,"], "w": [10.115, 10.355, 10.55, 10.906, 11.146, 11.641, 11.974, 12.168]}, {"a": 12.776, "b": 15.196, "t": "Cats living without people are mostly quiet.", "k": ["without"], "w": [12.826, 13.066, 13.398, 13.776, 14.109, 14.303, 14.635]}, {"a": 15.196, "b": 17.636, "t": "The meow is something they mostly save for us.", "k": ["something"], "w": [15.246, 15.424, 15.645, 15.781, 16.214, 16.435, 16.741, 16.962, 17.14]}, {"a": 17.636, "b": 19.566, "t": "Now the detail you might be missing.", "k": ["missing."], "w": [17.686, 17.857, 18.028, 18.321, 18.492, 18.745, 18.875]}, {"a": 19.566, "b": 21.458, "t": "Your cat learns which meows work on you:", "k": ["learns"], "w": [19.616, 19.844, 20.029, 20.345, 20.617, 20.889, 21.117, 21.258]}, {"a": 21.458, "b": 24.105999999999998, "t": "one for food, one for the door, one for attention.", "k": ["attention."], "w": [21.508, 21.692, 21.877, 22.171, 22.355, 22.539, 22.724, 23.018, 23.202, 23.386]}, {"a": 24.105999999999998, "b": 26.566, "t": "Meowing at people is partly something they learn.", "k": ["something"], "w": [24.156, 24.503, 24.6